<p>Hello <%= @resource.name || @resource.email %>,</p>

<p>Someone requested a password reset for your T-Shirt Store account.</p>

<p>Click the link below to choose a new password. This link expires in <%= Devise.reset_password_within / 3600 %> hours.</p>

<p><a href="<%= @reset_url %>">Reset my password</a></p>

<p>If you didn't request this, you can safely ignore this email. Your password won't change.</p>
